%% Data-flow of the stored reference (how content reaches later visitors)
flowchart TD
    A["Attacker-controlled<br/>short reference<br/>(&lt;script src=URL&gt;)"] -->|manual save| B["Elgg DB<br/>profile metadata<br/>(briefdescription)"]
    B -->|rendered RAW by<br/>output/text.php| C["Profile HTML page"]
    C -->|served to every visitor| D["Victim browser<br/>(Elgg origin)"]
    D -->|GET URL| E["External JS host<br/>demo.js / xssworm.js"]
    E -->|script body| D
    D -. "THEORY ONLY:<br/>re-insert reference<br/>into viewer's own field" .-> B
    subgraph Defenses["Any one of these breaks the flow"]
        F["Output encoding<br/>(htmlspecialchars)"]
        G["Input filtering<br/>(HTMLawed/jsoup)"]
        H["CSP script-src"]
    end
    F -.->|neutralises C->D| C
    G -.->|blocks A->B| B
    H -.->|blocks D->E & inline| D
